To handle a requirement where filters are **optional** (meaning if you pass nothing, it returns everything; if you pass one filter, it filters by that one; if you pass all, it filters by all), the best and most professional way to do this in Spring Boot is using **JPA Specifications**.
Here are the step-by-step code files to create this dynamic filtering flow for the REQUEST_VOUCHER table.
### Step 1: Create the Entity Model
If you haven't mapped this table to a Java object yet, create this in your Models folder.
**File:** RequestVoucher.java (in com.fincore.VoucherService.Models)
```java
package com.fincore.VoucherService.Models;

import jakarta.persistence.*;
import lombok.Data;
import java.time.LocalDateTime;

@Entity
@Table(name = "REQUEST_VOUCHER")
@Data
public class RequestVoucher {

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    @Column(name = "ID")
    private Long id;

    @Column(name = "VID", length = 20, nullable = false)
    private String vid;

    @Column(name = "CATEGORY", length = 20, nullable = false)
    private String category;

    @Column(name = "DESCRIPTION", length = 500, nullable = false)
    private String description;

    @Column(name = "ALLOWED_ROLE", length = 100, nullable = false)
    private String allowedRole;

    @Column(name = "SD_REQ_NO", length = 100)
    private String sdReqNo;

    @Column(name = "CREATED_BY", length = 100)
    private String createdBy;

    @Column(name = "CREATED_AT", updatable = false)
    private LocalDateTime createdAt = LocalDateTime.now();

    @Column(name = "TERMINATED_BY", length = 100)
    private String terminatedBy;

    @Column(name = "TERMINATED_AT")
    private LocalDateTime terminatedAt;

    @Column(name = "STATUS", length = 30, nullable = false)
    private String status;

    @Column(name = "REMARKS", length = 50)
    private String remarks;
}

```
### Step 2: Create the Repository
To support dynamic filtering, the repository must extend JpaSpecificationExecutor.
**File:** RequestVoucherRepository.java (in com.fincore.VoucherService.Repository)
